1
00:00:55,384 --> 00:01:01,384
DC Showcase: Jonah Hex is a animation, action, western
film directed by Joaquim Dos Santos.

2
00:01:50,769 --> 00:01:56,769
When a ruthless brothel madame murders Jonah Hex's current quarry,
the disfigured bounty hunter plans to make her pay.

3
00:02:46,153 --> 00:02:52,153
Jonah Hex (voice), played by Thomas Jane.

4
00:03:41,538 --> 00:03:47,538
Madame Lorraine (voice), played by Linda Hamilton.

5
00:04:36,923 --> 00:04:42,923
Young Man / Bartender (voice), played by Jason Marsden.

6
00:05:32,307 --> 00:05:38,307
Red Doc (voice), played by Michael Rooker.

7
00:06:27,692 --> 00:06:33,692
Bar Girl (voice), played by Michelle Trachtenberg.

8
00:07:23,076 --> 00:07:29,076
Jonah Hex is a 2010 American Western superhero film based on
the DC Comics character of the same name.

9
00:08:18,461 --> 00:08:24,461
Directed by Jimmy Hayward (in his live-action debut) from a screenplay by Neveldine/Taylor, the film stars Josh Brolin in
the title role, alongside John Malkovich, Megan Fox, Michael Fassbender, Will Arnett and Michael Shannon.

10
00:09:13,846 --> 00:09:19,846
Produced by Legendary Pictures, Andrew Lazar's Mad Chance Productions and Akiva Goldsman's
Weed Road Pictures, the film was released on June 18, 2010, by Warner Bros.

11
00:10:09,230 --> 00:10:15,230
It was a commercial failure, having grossed only $11
million against a budget of $47 million.

12
00:11:04,615 --> 00:11:10,615
It received generally negative reviews from critics.
